        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed as part of a new employee training program at Byking Inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your PC environment, the game may not function properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected issues or bugs may also occur during gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Line 'em up! Clear 'em out! Defend the castle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have 3 basic strategies at their disposal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of each and aim for a clear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >―Line 'em up!—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can blow the &quot;Mofu&quot; onto adjacent lanes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this to change their position and line 'em up nicely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/e857a80210a27d95e78e2fa6a5701e3d.poster.avif?t=1780471419\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/e857a80210a27d95e78e2fa6a5701e3d.webm?t=1780471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/e857a80210a27d95e78e2fa6a5701e3d.mp4?t=1780471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >―Clear 'em out!—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack the &quot;Mofu&quot; to clear them from the field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line-up several &quot;Mofu&quot; with the same color, and you can clear them all at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/a41dcca82370d7a5accba4e474dc8adc.poster.avif?t=1780471419\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/a41dcca82370d7a5accba4e474dc8adc.webm?t=1780471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/a41dcca82370d7a5accba4e474dc8adc.mp4?t=1780471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >―Defend the castle!—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful of your castle's weak-points. Do not allow the &quot;Mofu&quot; to breach that line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a witch, players have 2 types of orbs on hand. Use them wisely, and protect your castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▼X marks on the grid are weak-points. If the &quot;Mofu&quot; reach it your castle integrity will drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/bb6791db7d394820e90b6d8df87a5f98.avif?t=1780471419\" width=300 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▼Magical orbs can be used for blocking or attacking the &quot;Mofu&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/5a0d5da1a2c4aecfbe03f7e75c3d5a96.avif?t=1780471419\" width=294 height=222 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Let's clear some missions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing additional &quot;missions&quot; in a stage will affect your result!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge more to get the highest score!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/07bdcc97b89e905bb298613b860a5c79.avif?t=1780471419\" width=1460 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed as part of a new employee training program at Byking Inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your PC environment, the game may not function properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected issues or bugs may also occur during gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Line 'em up! Clear 'em out! Defend the castle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have 3 basic strategies at their disposal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of each and aim for a clear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >―Line 'em up!—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can blow the &quot;Mofu&quot; onto adjacent lanes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this to change their position and line 'em up nicely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/e857a80210a27d95e78e2fa6a5701e3d.poster.avif?t=1780471419\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/e857a80210a27d95e78e2fa6a5701e3d.webm?t=1780471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/e857a80210a27d95e78e2fa6a5701e3d.mp4?t=1780471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >―Clear 'em out!—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack the &quot;Mofu&quot; to clear them from the field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line-up several &quot;Mofu&quot; with the same color, and you can clear them all at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/a41dcca82370d7a5accba4e474dc8adc.poster.avif?t=1780471419\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/a41dcca82370d7a5accba4e474dc8adc.webm?t=1780471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/a41dcca82370d7a5accba4e474dc8adc.mp4?t=1780471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >―Defend the castle!—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful of your castle's weak-points. Do not allow the &quot;Mofu&quot; to breach that line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a witch, players have 2 types of orbs on hand. Use them wisely, and protect your castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▼X marks on the grid are weak-points. If the &quot;Mofu&quot; reach it your castle integrity will drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/bb6791db7d394820e90b6d8df87a5f98.avif?t=1780471419\" width=300 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▼Magical orbs can be used for blocking or attacking the &quot;Mofu&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/5a0d5da1a2c4aecfbe03f7e75c3d5a96.avif?t=1780471419\" width=294 height=222 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Let's clear some missions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing additional &quot;missions&quot; in a stage will affect your result!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge more to get the highest score!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767270/extras/07bdcc97b89e905bb298613b860a5c79.avif?t=1780471419\" width=1460 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
